# What this project waits on upstream, read by scripts/upstream.sh.
#
#   issue|pr <owner/repo>#<n>      | why it matters
#   crate <name>                   | why it matters (compares Cargo.lock to crates.io)
#   search <owner/repo> <terms...> | a problem we have that isn't reported there;
#                                    new matches are shown, in case someone has
#
# Read-only: nothing here is filed or commented on upstream.

# unrar_sys (our fork, see Cargo.toml)
pr     muja/unrar.rs#81                     | builds for the target, not the host, and for Android: most of our unrar_sys commit
search muja/unrar.rs SIGILL                 | cpu_supports.hpp in our unrar_sys: __builtin_cpu_supports and an x86-64-v3 libgcc
search muja/unrar.rs cpu_supports           | the same

# egui-winit (our egui fork)
pr     emilk/egui#8657                      | winit's Wayland clipboard instead of smithay's: may make the shared-clipboard patch moot
search emilk/egui data_offer                | the Wayland connection dying when a viewport's clipboard is dropped (our egui-winit)
search emilk/egui paste key clipboard empty | Ctrl+V dropped when the clipboard has no text (our egui-winit, file_clipboard::PasteKey)
issue  emilk/egui#2108                      | image paste events: would replace passing Ctrl+V through for markdown::assets

# mermaid-rs-renderer (our fork)
pr     1jehuang/mermaid-rs-renderer#159     | web_time's Instant, as our fork does: the browser panic
pr     1jehuang/mermaid-rs-renderer#155     | the same, another way
pr     1jehuang/mermaid-rs-renderer#125     | the same, another way
issue  1jehuang/mermaid-rs-renderer#120     | the same, asked for
pr     1jehuang/mermaid-rs-renderer#108     | an embedded font instead of the ~/.cache/mmdr copy; we'd still want register_font
search 1jehuang/mermaid-rs-renderer Instant | the browser panic, in case of another fix
search 1jehuang/mermaid-rs-renderer cache   | the font copy it writes to ~/.cache/mmdr

# Held back
issue  anhosh/egui_dock#352                 | egui 0.37: the app stays on egui 0.36 until egui_dock moves
pr     anhosh/egui_dock#354                 | the same
issue  emilk/egui#8805                      | Wayland drag and drop in winit: could replace src/wayland_dnd.rs

crate  egui                                 | held at 0.36 by egui_dock
crate  egui_dock                            | holds egui back
crate  egui-winit                           | patched (our egui fork)
crate  unrar_sys                            | patched (our unrar.rs fork)
crate  mermaid-rs-renderer                  | patched (our fork)
